Hi Matt,
Rolling back to Zelig 3.5 works like this:

1. download http://r.iq.harvard.edu/src/contrib/Zelig_3.5.3.tar.gz
(huh, is this no longer available on the new website?)

2. in R:
/remove.packages("Zelig")//
//install.packages("/PATH/TO/Zelig_3.5.3.tar.gz", repos = NULL, 
type="source") //
/
(there may be some differences depending on your OS...)
3. restart R session







